        "confidence": 0.8317,
        "text": "University Warangal, signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) today with United Way of Hyderabad. The collaboration is designed to provide focused training to 250 students in soft skills and data science, equipping them with industry-relevant competencies to boost their placement readiness. The MoU signing was held in the presence of Prof. K.Pratap Reddy, Vice- Chancellor of Kakatiya University, Prof. V. Ramachandram, Registrar, and Dr. N. Ramana, Principal of KUCET. Dr V Mahendar, and Mr. Santhosh Kumar, TPO also participated in the program. From United Way of Hyderabad Mr. Bharath Merugu, Manager, and Ms. Soumya Maireddy, Senior Associate attended.",
